1
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:46,019
All these years

2
00:01:49,019 --> 00:01:50,819
in this house,

3
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:55,280
I've been enduring every humiliation

4
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,819
and walking on thin ice.

5
00:02:02,700 --> 00:02:04,040
I thought everything I did

6
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:05,739
was worth it,

7
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:09,280
that one day we'd leave this place

8
00:02:10,020 --> 00:02:11,719
and live our own lives.

9
00:02:14,139 --> 00:02:14,759
But what did I get

10
00:02:14,759 --> 00:02:16,099
in the end?

11
00:02:22,460 --> 00:02:23,939
Fine.

12
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:27,419
I've had enough

13
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,520
of being the third concubine!

14
00:02:31,819 --> 00:02:32,879
- Wanqiao.
- Let go of me!

15
00:02:32,879 --> 00:02:33,560
- Calm down.
- Let go!

16
00:02:33,659 --> 00:02:34,860
- Let go of me!
- Calm down!

17
00:02:34,900 --> 00:02:35,800
I'm telling you,

18
00:02:35,900 --> 00:02:37,020
I'll let everyone in this house

19
00:02:37,020 --> 00:02:38,020
know!

20
00:03:11,780 --> 00:03:12,620
There's no turning back

21
00:03:14,300 --> 00:03:16,139
from this road once you start.

22
00:03:18,180 --> 00:03:19,020
I swear

23
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:22,419
I won't let anyone

24
00:03:26,319 --> 00:03:27,800
stand in the way of our plan.

25
00:03:40,379 --> 00:03:42,180
Remember what you said.

26
00:03:45,180 --> 00:03:46,180
Don't forget.

27
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:49,599
You're never the only one

28
00:03:51,860 --> 00:03:53,780
standing at the edge of the cliff.

29
00:04:52,740 --> 00:04:53,800
Time to work!

30
00:04:54,139 --> 00:04:55,279
Stop playing dead!

31
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:00,980
Want another taste of the whip?

32
00:05:03,279 --> 00:05:04,120
Hurry up!

33
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:06,100
Stop dragging your feet!

34
00:05:23,339 --> 00:05:24,319
Work hard!

35
00:05:25,300 --> 00:05:26,360
No work, no food!

36
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:27,519
Move it!

37
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:29,319
Move it.

38
00:05:29,439 --> 00:05:30,180
Put your back into it!

39
00:05:30,639 --> 00:05:31,339
Load it on the truck.

40
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:33,040
Stop dawdling!

41
00:05:33,759 --> 00:05:34,180
Get moving!

42
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,300
What are you playing at?

43
00:05:36,639 --> 00:05:38,300
- Get up.
- Load it up!

44
00:05:38,500 --> 00:05:41,339
- Hurry!
- Move it!

45
00:05:43,519 --> 00:05:44,079
You up there!

46
00:05:44,639 --> 00:05:45,759
Nobody slack off!

47
00:05:46,779 --> 00:05:47,360
Hurry up!

48
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:48,740
Dig now!

49
00:05:51,300 --> 00:05:52,060
Don't stop.

50
00:05:52,379 --> 00:05:53,680
Nobody slacks off!

51
00:05:56,879 --> 00:05:57,879
- Hurry up.
- What are you staring at?

52
00:05:57,879 --> 00:05:58,879
Quit staring!

53
00:05:59,519 --> 00:06:00,759
Get to work! No slacking!

54
00:06:04,259 --> 00:06:05,259
No slacking, any of you!

55
00:06:06,759 --> 00:06:07,740
You want to eat or not?

56
00:06:13,779 --> 00:06:14,459
Move it!

57
00:06:15,759 --> 00:06:16,500
No slacking!

58
00:06:17,339 --> 00:06:18,160
Put your back into it!

59
00:06:20,100 --> 00:06:20,920
Stop dawdling!

60
00:06:21,699 --> 00:06:22,120
Get moving!

61
00:06:24,959 --> 00:06:25,459
Yeah, you!

62
00:06:26,839 --> 00:06:27,339
Hurry up!

63
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:29,180
Move it!

64
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,199
You up there!

65
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:35,240
Move it.

66
00:06:36,079 --> 00:06:36,540
Dig now!

67
00:06:39,180 --> 00:06:39,980
Don't stop.

68
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:45,379
Dig faster.

69
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:46,879
Get to work!

70
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:51,879
They're short-handed these days.

71
00:06:52,279 --> 00:06:53,040
The guard tower's

72
00:06:53,540 --> 00:06:54,519
three o'clock shift change

73
00:06:54,519 --> 00:06:55,519
has been extended by ten minutes.

74
00:06:56,199 --> 00:06:57,480
This is our last chance.

75
00:06:57,660 --> 00:06:58,160
Alright.

76
00:07:02,019 --> 00:07:03,160
He had his ribs broken,

77
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:04,720
was branded with hot irons,

78
00:07:05,079 --> 00:07:06,439
and strung up for three days and nights.

79
00:07:06,620 --> 00:07:08,439
And he still incited the others to escape.

80
00:07:14,199 --> 00:07:15,600
That kind of iron will

81
00:07:16,819 --> 00:07:17,660
is exactly why

82
00:07:17,660 --> 00:07:19,339
you can't bear to kill him, General Mou.

83
00:07:22,180 --> 00:07:23,660
I've always valued talent.

84
00:07:24,079 --> 00:07:24,720
When Jiang Xueting

85
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,060
ran the Revival Newspaper,

86
00:07:27,540 --> 00:07:28,759
a mere hundred-word piece,

87
00:07:28,759 --> 00:07:30,000
Record of a Warlord's Massacre,

88
00:07:30,540 --> 00:07:32,540
got student unions in 10 provinces to strike.

89
00:07:33,779 --> 00:07:35,540
One article, On Embezzled Military Pay,

90
00:07:35,879 --> 00:07:38,000
forced a shake-up at the Finance Ministry.

91
00:07:40,339 --> 00:07:41,980
He's such a perfect weapon.

92
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:46,439
His pen is sharp.

93
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,639
And he's got guts and drive.

94
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:51,740
Move!

95
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:58,980
If you can't make

96
00:08:00,220 --> 00:08:02,040
a man like that submit completely,

97
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:06,180
then taking a little more time is no waste.

98
00:08:32,919 --> 00:08:33,360
Don't move!

99
00:08:41,460 --> 00:08:42,460
What are you doing?

100
00:08:42,980 --> 00:08:44,500
Don't feel sorry for him, General Mou.

101
00:08:45,740 --> 00:08:46,700
He

102
00:08:47,799 --> 00:08:49,220
can still hold a pen.

103
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:53,100
A lifelong cripple

104
00:08:53,919 --> 00:08:56,019
is the only way to crush his pride.

105
00:09:00,419 --> 00:09:02,159
A grudge branded into the bone

106
00:09:04,639 --> 00:09:06,840
is the strongest motivation.

107
00:09:25,159 --> 00:09:27,159
Miss, these are Mr. Kuang's clothes.

108
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,279
All pressed.

109
00:09:28,899 --> 00:09:29,940
Just set them aside.

110
00:09:35,759 --> 00:09:36,299
By the way,

111
00:09:39,279 --> 00:09:40,919
this was in Mr. Kuang's inner pocket.

112
00:09:41,100 --> 00:09:42,259
He forgot to take it out.

113
00:09:47,899 --> 00:09:49,899
Actually, Mr. Kuang

114
00:09:49,899 --> 00:09:50,940
really cares about you.

115
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:53,139
We can all see it plain as day.

116
00:09:53,700 --> 00:09:55,100
The blankets in this room.

117
00:09:55,460 --> 00:09:56,840
And the cushions on that couch.

118
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:58,580
He specifically asked

119
00:09:58,580 --> 00:09:59,980
for thicker ones.

120
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:01,139
And look over there.

121
00:10:01,799 --> 00:10:03,740
All the corners you could bump into

122
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:06,340
have been wrapped in soft cloth.

123
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:09,639
Mr. Kuang keeps saying,

124
00:10:10,100 --> 00:10:11,539
whatever you want to eat

125
00:10:11,539 --> 00:10:12,419
or need,

126
00:10:12,539 --> 00:10:13,600
just let him know anytime.

127
00:10:14,139 --> 00:10:15,639
He'll go get it himself.

128
00:10:21,220 --> 00:10:22,019
Qiujuan.

129
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:23,600
I'm a little tired.

130
00:10:24,159 --> 00:10:25,120
Help me to the bed

131
00:10:25,700 --> 00:10:26,620
to lie down for a bit.

132
00:10:52,740 --> 00:10:54,659
Miss, what's wrong?

133
00:10:55,019 --> 00:10:56,620
Are you feeling unwell?

134
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:58,279
What's the matter, miss?

135
00:10:58,639 --> 00:10:59,899
Don't scare me!

136
00:11:01,700 --> 00:11:02,279
Blood!

137
00:11:02,740 --> 00:11:03,960
How is there blood?

138
00:11:04,299 --> 00:11:05,059
Somebody help!

139
00:11:05,500 --> 00:11:06,139
Miss!

140
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:14,240
She's been in there so long.

141
00:11:14,639 --> 00:11:16,700
Why isn't she out yet?

142
00:11:19,379 --> 00:11:20,940
Ma'am, don't worry.

143
00:11:21,399 --> 00:11:22,399
Sit down and rest a bit.

144
00:11:22,980 --> 00:11:24,980
Jinxuan has always been blessed.

145
00:11:25,179 --> 00:11:26,460
She'll be fine.

146
00:11:27,259 --> 00:11:27,960
That's right, Mother.

147
00:11:28,220 --> 00:11:29,759
We've already notified Father, Bingwen,

148
00:11:29,759 --> 00:11:30,700
and Changxuan.

149
00:11:30,980 --> 00:11:32,580
They're on their way back now.

150
00:11:33,139 --> 00:11:34,159
Jinxuan's always been

151
00:11:34,159 --> 00:11:35,179
healthy.

152
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:36,840
The baby will be fine too.

153
00:11:37,059 --> 00:11:38,039
Don't worry, Mother.

154
00:11:45,419 --> 00:11:46,299
Dr. Jiang.

155
00:11:46,580 --> 00:11:47,779
How's my daughter?

156
00:11:48,659 --> 00:11:49,480
She showed

157
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:50,779
signs of a miscarriage.

158
00:11:51,399 --> 00:11:52,120
Thankfully,

159
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:52,940
the baby's been saved.

160
00:11:53,740 --> 00:11:55,340
Jinxuan is out of danger now.

161
00:11:55,340 --> 00:11:56,240
Rest assured, everyone.

162
00:11:56,399 --> 00:11:57,320
Are you sure?

163
00:11:57,559 --> 00:11:58,740
We just gave her

164
00:11:58,740 --> 00:12:00,299
a full examination.

165
00:12:00,340 --> 00:12:01,779
Please don't worry, Mrs. Yu.

166
00:12:02,879 --> 00:12:04,340
Thank God.

167
00:12:05,700 --> 00:12:06,340
But

168
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:08,039
how could Jinxuan show

169
00:12:08,039 --> 00:12:09,519
signs of a miscarriage?

170
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:11,379
Everyone's body is different.

171
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:13,600
The tests show

172
00:12:13,779 --> 00:12:14,779
she may have been exposed

173
00:12:14,779 --> 00:12:15,799
to something

174
00:12:15,799 --> 00:12:17,539
that can cause a miscarriage.

175
00:12:18,539 --> 00:12:19,639
That doesn't make sense.

176
00:12:21,139 --> 00:12:22,639
Ever since she got pregnant,

177
00:12:22,679 --> 00:12:24,399
our own people

178
00:12:24,399 --> 00:12:26,139
have been caring for her.

179
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:28,799
I made sure her daily food and drink

180
00:12:28,799 --> 00:12:30,440
were handled with extra care.

181
00:12:30,899 --> 00:12:32,860
The tests alone can't pinpoint

182
00:12:32,860 --> 00:12:34,700
the exact cause.

183
00:12:35,500 --> 00:12:37,059
If you need anything later,

184
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:38,179
just have Mr. Zhou

185
00:12:38,179 --> 00:12:39,200
call me anytime.

186
00:12:41,679 --> 00:12:42,679
Thank you, doctor.

187
00:12:45,279 --> 00:12:46,080
Investigate!

188
00:12:46,799 --> 00:12:48,799
Have Zhou Tai look into it right now.

189
00:12:49,279 --> 00:12:51,080
Check every maid and manservant

190
00:12:51,179 --> 00:12:52,139
who's been caring

191
00:12:52,139 --> 00:12:53,779
for Jinxuan.

192
00:12:53,980 --> 00:12:54,860
Yes, ma'am.

193
00:13:00,740 --> 00:13:03,340
Commander, ma'am, we've already checked.

194
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:05,179
The Fourth Miss's food and drink,

195
00:13:05,179 --> 00:13:06,460
including soups and pastries,

196
00:13:06,460 --> 00:13:07,740
were absolutely fine.

197
00:13:07,940 --> 00:13:08,899
Everyone in the household

198
00:13:08,899 --> 00:13:10,360
responsible for her meals

199
00:13:10,460 --> 00:13:11,639
has been questioned too.

200
00:13:11,779 --> 00:13:13,039
Nothing unusual found.

201
00:13:13,940 --> 00:13:15,480
The food's fine?

202
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:18,259
Then how could Jinxuan

203
00:13:18,259 --> 00:13:19,039
just...?

204
00:13:19,039 --> 00:13:19,918
Commander, ma'am,

205
00:13:20,379 --> 00:13:22,059
according to the hospital's diagnosis

206
00:13:22,059 --> 00:13:23,480
and lab reports,

207
00:13:23,980 --> 00:13:24,980
Lady Jinxuan

208
00:13:24,980 --> 00:13:26,519
was indeed exposed to

209
00:13:26,519 --> 00:13:28,080
something that can cause a miscarriage.

210
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:30,559
If it's not the food,

211
00:13:30,820 --> 00:13:32,120
then think about

212
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:33,840
whether she's come into contact

213
00:13:34,419 --> 00:13:35,840
with anything new

214
00:13:35,919 --> 00:13:36,840
in her daily life,

215
00:13:37,159 --> 00:13:38,159
or anything

216
00:13:39,100 --> 00:13:40,899
she never touched before.

217
00:13:41,679 --> 00:13:42,440
Qiujuan,

218
00:13:42,960 --> 00:13:43,580
you've been

219
00:13:43,580 --> 00:13:45,279
with Jinxuan the whole time.

220
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:47,580
Think hard.

221
00:13:49,679 --> 00:13:51,000
A while back,

222
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:52,399
the Fourth Miss started using

223
00:13:52,399 --> 00:13:53,379
a medicinal pillow.

224
00:13:53,659 --> 00:13:55,360
Said it was for calming the nerves.

225
00:13:55,679 --> 00:13:58,240
A medicinal pillow? Who gave it to her?

226
00:14:05,139 --> 00:14:07,259
What's going on? Talk!

227
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:12,320
Father, Mother, I gave

228
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:13,840
that medicinal pillow to Jinxuan.

229
00:14:14,039 --> 00:14:15,940
It has some calming herbs inside.

230
00:14:16,039 --> 00:14:17,039
I had

231
00:14:17,039 --> 00:14:18,679
a doctor look at the prescription.

232
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:30,480
I knew about this.

233
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:31,960
Pingjun did make

234
00:14:32,039 --> 00:14:33,159
a medicinal pillow a couple days ago.

235
00:14:33,879 --> 00:14:35,200
But I found the fabric

236
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:36,600
for her.

237
00:14:37,399 --> 00:14:38,279
It's absolutely fine.

238
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:41,139
Bring me the pillow.

239
00:14:41,559 --> 00:14:42,120
Yes, sir.

240
00:14:42,779 --> 00:14:43,200
Go.

241
00:15:01,539 --> 00:15:03,360
True. Most of it is

242
00:15:03,460 --> 00:15:04,700
calming herbs.

243
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:05,860
But

244
00:15:06,440 --> 00:15:07,820
it's mixed with a hefty amount

245
00:15:07,820 --> 00:15:08,740
of musk.

246
00:15:11,019 --> 00:15:12,039
If...

247
00:15:13,360 --> 00:15:14,320
a pregnant woman

248
00:15:15,580 --> 00:15:17,500
is exposed to musk over time,

249
00:15:17,700 --> 00:15:19,419
it can cause restless fetal movement,

250
00:15:20,039 --> 00:15:21,379
or even a miscarriage.

251
00:15:27,539 --> 00:15:29,399
You've just been married into this family,

252
00:15:30,279 --> 00:15:31,620
and you're already scheming like this?

253
00:15:32,860 --> 00:15:33,460
Talk!

254
00:15:34,059 --> 00:15:35,559
Why did you try to harm Jinxuan?

255
00:15:35,820 --> 00:15:36,639
Zhongquan,

256
00:15:36,879 --> 00:15:37,820
we haven't gotten

257
00:15:37,820 --> 00:15:39,100
to the bottom of this yet.

258
00:15:39,100 --> 00:15:40,539
Don't scare her.

259
00:15:40,740 --> 00:15:42,059
Let her explain.

260
00:15:42,860 --> 00:15:43,460
Go on.

261
00:15:46,700 --> 00:15:47,519
Father, Mother,

262
00:15:47,940 --> 00:15:49,340
I bought every single herb

263
00:15:49,340 --> 00:15:50,559
for that medicinal pillow myself

264
00:15:50,559 --> 00:15:52,200
at the pharmacy, following the prescription.

265
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:54,080
It's all calming herbs.

266
00:15:54,220 --> 00:15:55,840
There's no way there's musk in it.

267
00:15:57,379 --> 00:15:58,440
It is musk.

268
00:15:59,639 --> 00:16:01,340
We have both witnesses and evidence.

269
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:03,259
And you're still denying it?

270
00:16:03,639 --> 00:16:06,460
These herbs went from the pharmacy

271
00:16:06,639 --> 00:16:07,860
through washing, drying,

272
00:16:08,179 --> 00:16:09,159
and finally being sewn into the pillow.

273
00:16:09,840 --> 00:16:11,000
So many hands

274
00:16:11,500 --> 00:16:12,659
have touched them at every single step.

275
00:16:12,940 --> 00:16:15,240
Why are you so sure it was Pingjun?

276
00:16:16,139 --> 00:16:17,240
I believe Pingjun.

277
00:16:18,259 --> 00:16:19,659
She would never do this.

278
00:16:20,059 --> 00:16:21,759
Changxuan's right.

279
00:16:21,759 --> 00:16:23,440
Many people handled it.

280
00:16:23,679 --> 00:16:24,720
How can you say

281
00:16:24,720 --> 00:16:26,039
it was definitely her?

282
00:16:26,480 --> 00:16:27,659
And even if we go there,

283
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:29,500
there has to be a motive.

284
00:16:30,399 --> 00:16:32,139
Pingjun has no grudge against Jinxuan.

285
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:33,440
Why would she harm her?

286
00:16:33,840 --> 00:16:34,659
Jealousy.

287
00:16:35,639 --> 00:16:37,399
If Jinxuan has the baby,

288
00:16:37,860 --> 00:16:39,679
it'll be the Yu family's first grandson.

289
00:16:40,399 --> 00:16:42,500
You couldn't stand that,

290
00:16:42,700 --> 00:16:44,700
so you got this twisted idea.

291
00:16:45,200 --> 00:16:45,860
Right?

292
00:16:46,019 --> 00:16:46,860
Father.

293
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:48,399
Making wild guesses like that

294
00:16:48,399 --> 00:16:49,860
is way too arbitrary.

295
00:16:50,860 --> 00:16:51,740
But Changxuan,

296
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:53,419
since the pillow

297
00:16:53,600 --> 00:16:54,759
was from Pingjun

298
00:16:54,759 --> 00:16:56,259
to Jinxuan,

299
00:16:56,820 --> 00:16:57,659
you can't

300
00:16:57,659 --> 00:16:58,700
play favorites here.

301
00:16:58,799 --> 00:16:59,980
You need to get to the bottom of it.

302
00:17:00,720 --> 00:17:01,679
If we ever find out

303
00:17:01,799 --> 00:17:03,279
who hurt Jinxuan,

304
00:17:03,600 --> 00:17:04,539
I won't let them off!

305
00:17:06,599 --> 00:17:08,299
Father, Mother,

306
00:17:08,799 --> 00:17:10,460
I know you're worried about Jinxuan.

307
00:17:10,660 --> 00:17:12,519
Ever since I found out Jinxuan was pregnant,

308
00:17:12,740 --> 00:17:14,039
I've been happier than anyone.

309
00:17:14,359 --> 00:17:15,480
I've never been jealous of her,

310
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:16,599
not for a second.

311
00:17:17,259 --> 00:17:18,940
As long as the truth comes out,

312
00:17:19,039 --> 00:17:21,299
I'll cooperate with any investigation.

313
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:31,940
Father, Mother,

314
00:17:33,460 --> 00:17:34,460
can I have a word?

315
00:17:40,539 --> 00:17:40,779
Don't.

316
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:41,660
Father.

317
00:17:42,519 --> 00:17:42,839
Mother.

318
00:17:44,140 --> 00:17:45,240
Pingjun and I...

319
00:17:49,900 --> 00:17:51,200
What are they saying?

320
00:17:54,660 --> 00:17:55,460
Changxuan.

321
00:17:58,200 --> 00:17:58,920
Don't worry.

322
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:01,140
I asked Father for three days.

323
00:18:01,940 --> 00:18:02,940
I'll get to the bottom of this.

324
00:18:40,059 --> 00:18:40,859
Let go of me!

325
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:43,480
You're hurting me!

326
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:55,940
You're pointing a gun at me?

327
00:18:58,259 --> 00:18:59,220
It was you, wasn't it?

328
00:19:15,140 --> 00:19:16,579
Didn't I tell you

329
00:19:18,940 --> 00:19:20,680
not to act rashly?

330
00:19:22,579 --> 00:19:23,380
What?

331
00:19:24,539 --> 00:19:25,519
Does it break your heart?

332
00:19:25,539 --> 00:19:27,279
That's my child!

333
00:19:27,279 --> 00:19:28,279
Your child?

334
00:19:28,579 --> 00:19:30,119
That's the Yu family's child.

335
00:19:30,880 --> 00:19:31,880
Named Yu!

336
00:19:34,720 --> 00:19:36,119
What does it have to do with you?

337
00:19:42,480 --> 00:19:44,119
We made it through everything together.

338
00:19:44,579 --> 00:19:45,559
We slept under bridges.

339
00:19:46,359 --> 00:19:47,240
We ate rats.

340
00:19:48,220 --> 00:19:49,319
We got chased and beaten.

341
00:19:49,319 --> 00:19:50,579
We almost died!

342
00:19:51,619 --> 00:19:52,319
And all of it

343
00:19:53,380 --> 00:19:55,200
was because of the Yu family.

344
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:01,859
Stop eating! Spit it out!

345
00:20:01,900 --> 00:20:03,140
- Spit it out!
- Wanqiao.

346
00:20:03,220 --> 00:20:04,759
- Stop it.
- You can't eat this!

347
00:20:05,039 --> 00:20:05,680
Be good.

348
00:20:10,119 --> 00:20:10,799
Bingwen.

349
00:20:11,799 --> 00:20:13,619
All we have now is each other.

350
00:20:17,140 --> 00:20:18,819
The one who made us like this

351
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:20,700
is Yu Zhongquan.

352
00:20:22,099 --> 00:20:22,900
Remember.

353
00:20:23,839 --> 00:20:25,259
You have to survive.

354
00:20:27,119 --> 00:20:28,599
We have to get our revenge!

355
00:20:30,079 --> 00:20:30,759
Bingwen,

356
00:20:31,599 --> 00:20:33,019
whatever you do from now on,

357
00:20:33,839 --> 00:20:35,079
I'll help you do it.

358
00:20:35,559 --> 00:20:37,460
Wherever you go, I'll go.

359
00:20:37,839 --> 00:20:39,160
We'll never be apart.

360
00:20:42,779 --> 00:20:43,779
Didn't you say it yourself?

361
00:20:44,539 --> 00:20:45,880
You want the Yu family

362
00:20:46,500 --> 00:20:48,140
to be utterly destroyed.

363
00:20:50,019 --> 00:20:50,839
So

364
00:20:52,579 --> 00:20:53,500
wouldn't it be nice

365
00:20:53,500 --> 00:20:54,460
to start

366
00:20:55,839 --> 00:20:57,839
by getting rid of their first grandson?

367
00:21:00,680 --> 00:21:01,900
You should be happy.

368
00:21:03,579 --> 00:21:04,819
Why aren't you smiling?

369
00:21:19,099 --> 00:21:20,119
Don't think I don't know

370
00:21:20,119 --> 00:21:21,559
what's going on in your head.

371
00:21:23,440 --> 00:21:24,119
I'm going to cut off

372
00:21:24,119 --> 00:21:25,299
every last one of your hopes!

373
00:21:26,880 --> 00:21:27,859
You dragged me

374
00:21:29,460 --> 00:21:30,920
into this revenge.

375
00:21:33,920 --> 00:21:35,259
I put everything on the line,

376
00:21:37,799 --> 00:21:38,660
including you.

377
00:23:11,759 --> 00:23:13,400
Have you been keeping records

378
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:14,779
of the herbs coming in and out?

379
00:23:15,480 --> 00:23:16,000
Yes.

380
00:23:19,039 --> 00:23:19,700
The shop

381
00:23:19,700 --> 00:23:21,160
keeps detailed records

382
00:23:21,160 --> 00:23:22,220
of daily stock in and out.

383
00:23:23,559 --> 00:23:24,619
What's written in this ledger

384
00:23:25,039 --> 00:23:26,420
matches exactly the amounts

385
00:23:26,539 --> 00:23:27,420
on the young madam's prescription.

386
00:23:34,140 --> 00:23:35,440
Could you have grabbed the wrong herbs?

387
00:23:44,799 --> 00:23:46,640
Mr. Zhou, it's the middle of the night.

388
00:23:46,640 --> 00:23:48,640
What does Young Master Changxuan want with me?

389
00:23:48,759 --> 00:23:50,000
I'm not sure of the details.

390
00:23:50,000 --> 00:23:50,759
Stop dawdling.

391
00:23:50,759 --> 00:23:51,680
Go report in.

392
00:24:07,180 --> 00:24:09,680
Ye Pingjun, this is all your fault!

393
00:24:11,220 --> 00:24:12,079
Just you wait.

394
00:24:21,200 --> 00:24:21,880
Qiuluo,

395
00:24:22,779 --> 00:24:24,039
aren't you supposed to be serving

396
00:24:24,039 --> 00:24:24,859
in Pingjun's room?

397
00:24:25,140 --> 00:24:26,779
What are you doing in the kitchen?

398
00:24:35,240 --> 00:24:37,160
We couldn't have grabbed the wrong herbs.

399
00:24:37,559 --> 00:24:39,059
Musk gives you a rash

400
00:24:39,059 --> 00:24:40,519
if you handle it too much.

401
00:24:40,700 --> 00:24:42,279
We're all very careful.

402
00:24:50,880 --> 00:24:52,380
Young Master Changxuan, she's here.

403
00:24:55,819 --> 00:24:56,460
Young Master Changxuan,

404
00:24:56,559 --> 00:24:58,099
did you send for me?

405
00:24:58,640 --> 00:24:59,539
Just a quick question.

406
00:25:00,440 --> 00:25:01,619
Noticed

407
00:25:02,019 --> 00:25:03,740
anyone around the house

408
00:25:04,240 --> 00:25:05,920
