409
00:25:07,859 --> 00:25:08,559
Not really..

410
00:25:10,319 --> 00:25:11,480
Think a little harder.

411
00:25:12,660 --> 00:25:14,019
Well, during laundry time,

412
00:25:14,019 --> 00:25:15,660
several girls

413
00:25:16,059 --> 00:25:17,680
share the tub,

414
00:25:18,059 --> 00:25:18,880
scrubbing right

415
00:25:18,880 --> 00:25:19,720
next to each other.

416
00:25:19,720 --> 00:25:21,200
You can see

417
00:25:21,400 --> 00:25:23,160
everyone's hands.

418
00:25:23,619 --> 00:25:25,019
If someone had

419
00:25:25,019 --> 00:25:26,579
red spots on her skin,

420
00:25:26,839 --> 00:25:28,259
she couldn't keep it a secret.

421
00:25:28,460 --> 00:25:29,819
I certainly

422
00:25:30,099 --> 00:25:31,539
didn't spot

423
00:25:31,539 --> 00:25:32,900
anything.

424
00:25:35,380 --> 00:25:36,099
Alright.

425
00:25:36,799 --> 00:25:37,539
Go turn in.

426
00:25:37,900 --> 00:25:39,039
Yes, Master...

427
00:25:42,599 --> 00:25:43,579
Wait, Master...

428
00:25:45,059 --> 00:25:46,200
it just hit me.

429
00:25:46,519 --> 00:25:48,220
It's been getting warmer,

430
00:25:48,619 --> 00:25:49,559
but one girl

431
00:25:49,559 --> 00:25:50,460
kept wearing this

432
00:25:50,460 --> 00:25:52,000
