433
00:25:52,319 --> 00:25:53,259
wrists

434
00:25:53,259 --> 00:25:54,779
completely covered.

435
00:25:54,980 --> 00:25:56,640
I thought I saw gauze

436
00:25:56,900 --> 00:25:58,119
under her sleeves...

437
00:25:58,940 --> 00:25:59,839
I wrote it off

438
00:25:59,839 --> 00:26:01,400
as some silly trend,

439
00:26:01,640 --> 00:26:02,660
like what the

440
00:26:02,660 --> 00:26:04,079
