441
00:26:04,259 --> 00:26:05,640
Thinking about it now…

442
00:26:06,299 --> 00:26:08,000
something about it felt off.

443
00:26:09,779 --> 00:26:11,119
Which girl was it?

444
00:26:11,740 --> 00:26:13,059
Search every

445
00:26:13,059 --> 00:26:14,299
damn corner!

446
00:26:20,720 --> 00:26:21,359
Check this out.

447
00:26:22,920 --> 00:26:24,079
Rash ointment!

448
00:26:24,339 --> 00:26:26,000
Where's Qiuluo?

449
00:26:26,420 --> 00:26:28,039
She said... she's got something urgent.

450
00:26:28,319 --> 00:26:29,960
Left maybe half an hour ago.

451
00:27:08,579 --> 00:27:11,180
The audacity of that girl,

452
00:27:11,660 --> 00:27:12,220
doing something

453
00:27:12,220 --> 00:27:13,740
so monstrous!

454
00:27:14,799 --> 00:27:15,759
And trying to

455
00:27:15,759 --> 00:27:17,220
slip away?

456
00:27:17,759 --> 00:27:18,720
She got

457
00:27:19,339 --> 00:27:20,180
what she deserved!

458
00:27:20,680 --> 00:27:22,279
Can you two quiet down?

459
00:27:22,619 --> 00:27:24,759
Your sister needs her rest.

460
00:27:30,059 --> 00:27:30,859
Pingjun,

461
00:27:32,079 --> 00:27:34,119
my husband rushed to judgment.

462
00:27:34,839 --> 00:27:36,460
Don't hold it against him.

463
00:27:39,019 --> 00:27:39,940
Sweetie,

464
00:27:40,579 --> 00:27:42,059
you never deserved any of that...

465
00:27:43,000 --> 00:27:44,480
Mother, Jinxuan,

466
00:27:44,799 --> 00:27:46,539
the air is cleared.

467
00:27:46,779 --> 00:27:48,339
That's what matters.

468
00:27:49,059 --> 00:27:49,980
I'm honestly fine.

469
00:27:52,019 --> 00:27:52,740
Zhou Tai

470
00:27:53,559 --> 00:27:54,480
has to clamp down

471
00:27:54,480 --> 00:27:56,400
on the staff,

472
00:27:56,779 --> 00:27:59,519
whether they've been here days or years.

473
00:27:59,960 --> 00:28:01,180
We can't let

474
00:28:01,180 --> 00:28:03,819
any more vipers in.

475
00:28:03,980 --> 00:28:06,240
Look at the mess this caused...

476
00:28:11,500 --> 00:28:12,500
Have more, sweetie.

477
00:28:18,160 --> 00:28:18,759
Dad,

478
00:28:20,640 --> 00:28:22,039
Qiuluo is dead now.

479
00:28:22,500 --> 00:28:24,200
Pingjun is completely innocent.

480
00:28:24,640 --> 00:28:26,460
Aren't you gonna make this right?

481
00:28:27,519 --> 00:28:28,579
Make what right?

482
00:28:29,099 --> 00:28:30,200
Apologize to her.

483
00:28:30,460 --> 00:28:31,559
Me? Apologize?

484
00:28:32,259 --> 00:28:33,240
Get this straight:

485
00:28:33,359 --> 00:28:34,119
I'm the head

486
00:28:34,119 --> 00:28:34,920
of this house.

487
00:28:34,920 --> 00:28:36,220
You kidding?

488
00:28:38,279 --> 00:28:40,339
Since the day you got with her,

489
00:28:41,119 --> 00:28:44,039
you threw all respect out the window!

490
00:28:46,880 --> 00:28:47,859
You're my father.

491
00:28:48,079 --> 00:28:49,079
I won't

492
00:28:49,460 --> 00:28:50,460
push it.

493
00:28:51,859 --> 00:28:52,839
Just lay off

494
00:28:53,400 --> 00:28:55,480
the animosity

495
00:28:56,279 --> 00:28:57,859
and show her some basic respect.

496
00:29:00,079 --> 00:29:01,960
Have you lost your

497
00:29:01,960 --> 00:29:03,119
damn mind?!

498
00:29:04,359 --> 00:29:06,099
Preaching to

499
00:29:06,440 --> 00:29:08,140
your own father for the sake of

500
00:29:08,140 --> 00:29:09,299
a woman!

501
00:29:09,880 --> 00:29:11,299
If you keep

502
00:29:11,299 --> 00:29:12,740
treating her like this,

503
00:29:14,460 --> 00:29:16,119
we will move out of this house.

504
00:29:16,900 --> 00:29:17,859
Suit yourself!

505
00:29:24,660 --> 00:29:27,480
Kitchen fixed up some ginseng soup.

506
00:29:29,519 --> 00:29:30,720
Have some, honey.

507
00:29:36,819 --> 00:29:40,880
This baby is a little fighter.

508
00:29:54,920 --> 00:29:55,660
Mom...

509
00:29:57,019 --> 00:29:58,359
To be honest,

510
00:29:59,019 --> 00:30:00,680
I never wanted

511
00:30:00,839 --> 00:30:02,519
to be a mother.

512
00:30:04,079 --> 00:30:05,740
I thought this child

513
00:30:05,940 --> 00:30:07,380
came at the worst time.

514
00:30:09,140 --> 00:30:10,480
When the doctor

515
00:30:11,180 --> 00:30:13,460
said he might

516
00:30:15,279 --> 00:30:17,099
not make it...

517
00:30:22,500 --> 00:30:24,200
it felt like my heart

518
00:30:25,720 --> 00:30:27,140
was being torn out...

519
00:30:30,920 --> 00:30:32,819
That was the moment it hit me...

520
00:30:34,079 --> 00:30:34,940
I couldn't bear

521
00:30:34,940 --> 00:30:37,440
the thought of losing this baby.

522
00:30:43,619 --> 00:30:45,740
That's the bond between

523
00:30:47,900 --> 00:30:50,819
mother and child.

524
00:30:51,119 --> 00:30:52,779
It's in our blood.

525
00:30:53,740 --> 00:30:56,140
It'll only get stronger

526
00:30:57,160 --> 00:30:59,259
as he grows.

527
00:31:02,359 --> 00:31:03,700
I hear you, Mom.

528
00:31:05,079 --> 00:31:06,640
He's a part of me.

529
00:31:11,700 --> 00:31:13,059
I won't let anything

530
00:31:13,059 --> 00:31:14,740
happen to him.

531
00:31:15,680 --> 00:31:17,539
I'll bring him

532
00:31:18,480 --> 00:31:21,140
into this world safe.

533
00:31:25,019 --> 00:31:26,960
My little girl is a mother now.

534
00:31:39,440 --> 00:31:41,279
Made you some warm

535
00:31:41,640 --> 00:31:42,680
almond tea.

536
00:31:42,799 --> 00:31:44,019
It helps you sleep.

537
00:31:51,579 --> 00:31:53,779
Thanks, I'll have it soon.

538
00:32:01,700 --> 00:32:02,740
Something else?

539
00:32:12,680 --> 00:32:14,259
About everything that happened...

540
00:32:16,180 --> 00:32:17,200
thank you.

541
00:32:28,339 --> 00:32:29,740
Curious

542
00:32:30,500 --> 00:32:31,440
what I told my parents

543
00:32:31,440 --> 00:32:33,099
behind that screen?

544
00:32:34,640 --> 00:32:35,759
What did you say?

545
00:32:39,839 --> 00:32:40,619
Told them

546
00:32:41,880 --> 00:32:43,940
you haven't let me in yet.

547
00:32:46,000 --> 00:32:47,259
You're still

548
00:32:48,000 --> 00:32:49,279
untouched.

549
00:32:51,119 --> 00:32:52,660
Why would you be jealous of Jinxuan?

550
00:32:54,240 --> 00:32:54,680
[Dad,]

551
00:32:55,480 --> 00:32:55,880
[Mom,]

552
00:32:58,880 --> 00:33:00,039
[we haven't]

553
00:33:01,339 --> 00:33:02,440
[even been intimate.]

554
00:33:04,380 --> 00:33:06,980
[God, you idiot...]

555
00:33:08,900 --> 00:33:09,559
[Then why]

556
00:33:09,559 --> 00:33:11,299
[bust your a** to]

557
00:33:11,960 --> 00:33:12,700
[marry her?!]

558
00:33:13,700 --> 00:33:14,319
[She's still recovering]

559
00:33:14,319 --> 00:33:15,579
[her memory.]

560
00:33:16,500 --> 00:33:19,079
[She won't see me as her husband]

561
00:33:19,680 --> 00:33:21,079
[until her heart is]

562
00:33:21,079 --> 00:33:21,759
[in it.]

563
00:33:22,700 --> 00:33:23,700
[I respect that.]

564
00:33:24,819 --> 00:33:25,559
[I'm willing]

565
00:33:26,099 --> 00:33:27,259
[to earn that]

566
00:33:27,259 --> 00:33:28,039
[with her.]

567
00:33:29,839 --> 00:33:32,880
[You're not firing blanks... are you?]

568
00:33:33,619 --> 00:33:34,299
[Dad.]

569
00:33:36,279 --> 00:33:37,480
[Give me three days.]

570
00:33:38,380 --> 00:33:39,640
[I'll get to the bottom of this.]

571
00:33:48,299 --> 00:33:50,579
Mom grilled me about grandkids today.

572
00:33:52,640 --> 00:33:54,099
Said she's waiting on an answer.

573
00:33:56,900 --> 00:33:57,740
So...

574
00:33:59,339 --> 00:34:00,140
when do you think

575
00:34:00,140 --> 00:34:01,480
I can give her one?

576
00:35:32,239 --> 00:35:33,039
Pingjun...

577
00:35:35,300 --> 00:35:36,340
After all this,

578
00:35:38,099 --> 00:35:39,039
is there still no room for me

579
00:35:39,039 --> 00:35:40,440
in your heart?

580
00:35:45,239 --> 00:35:46,300
I...

581
00:36:01,099 --> 00:36:01,900
Changxuan, please...

582
00:36:04,460 --> 00:36:05,320
Hey, it's fine.

583
00:36:07,059 --> 00:36:08,659
I'd never force you

584
00:36:09,659 --> 00:36:10,960
into anything.

585
00:36:12,260 --> 00:36:13,059
I can wait.

586
00:36:14,699 --> 00:36:16,400
Until you're ready for me.

587
00:36:28,380 --> 00:36:29,320
Pingjun...

588
00:36:30,500 --> 00:36:31,300
Where are you...

589
00:36:34,059 --> 00:36:35,280
[Did you hear?]

590
00:36:35,280 --> 00:36:36,940
[General Yu's tying]

